---

<CaseStudyLayout
  eyebrow="Project Two"
  title="Lorem <em>consectetur adipiscing</em> elit sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore dolore"
  tags="Category One, Category Two, Category Three, Category Four"
  year="2025"
  toc={toc}
  accent="#FACD1A"
  class="slate"
>
  <!-- ============ Hero ============ -->
  <div slot="hero" class="cs-hero slate-hero" data-reveal="up">
    <img
      src="/assets/images/OUiNs97sLahNgur9RlCpeOOsEoY.png"
      alt="Placeholder product screenshot"
      width="2880"
      height="2112"
      decoding="async"
      fetchpriority="high"
    />
  </div>

  <!-- ============ Introduction ============ -->
  <Section id="introduction" label="Section One" inset>
    <Row label="Label One">
      <p>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur. Adipiscing elit sed do eiusmod, tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua enim ad minim.</p>
      <p>Ut enim ad <strong>minim veniam quis nostrud exercitation, ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat duis</strong>, aute irure dolor in reprehenderit velit voluptate.</p>
    </Row>
    <Row label="Label Two">
      <p>Lorem ipsum (2 dolor) sit amet consectetur adipiscing, elit sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore.</p>
    </Row>
    <Row label="Label Three">
      <p>5 weeks</p>
    </Row>
  </Section>

  <!-- ============ TL;DR ============ -->
